OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry to examine disgraced
OL,4,Aformer councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has demanded an
OL,7,Findependent inquiry into what the
OL,8,Fauthority knew about a former
OL,9,Fcouncillor who committed sexual
OL,10,Foffences while in office.
OL,12,FRylan Ray, who was previously a
OL,13,FConservative member of Peterborough
OL,14,FCity Council, was convicted last month
OL,15,Fof 28 sexual offences, many involving
OL,16,Fchildren.
OL,18,FShabina Qayyum, the council's Labour
OL,19,Fleader, told the BBC she had called for
OL,20,Fa review, which would be "drawn up" by
OL,21,Fthe authority's children's services
OL,22,Fdepartment.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
